  <body>
    <section class="project-detail">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1>Babel Goods – E-commerce Platform</h1>

        <img src="/images/P1.png" alt="Babel Goods" class="project-banner" />

        <p class="description">
          🛍️ <strong>Online Sales — Simplified Management</strong><br />
          This platform is designed for Facebook online stores to simplify the tracking of sales, management of orders, products, and customer information.
        </p>

        <h2>🎯 Our Goal</h2>
        <p>
          Make the daily operations of online sellers easier with a clear and fast dashboard. No more scattered notes or messages — everything is centralized here: orders, payments, deliveries, and statistics.
        </p>

        <h2>🚀 Features</h2>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>📦 Manage and track all orders in one place</li>
          <li>🧾 Easily add or edit sold products</li>
          <li>📞 Organize customer information and print when needed</li>
          <li>📊 View real-time sales and stock statistics</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>👥 About the Project</h2>
        <p>
          This application was developed to meet the specific needs of Facebook sellers in Madagascar — a simple, modern, and local solution.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://babel-goods-fr.onrender.com/" target="_blank">🌐 Live Demo</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/Hassyunity/Babel" target="_blank">🔗 Source Code</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
